## §4 Pointers (optional)

If this methodology partially overlaps another methodology already in the repo (e.g. TDD overlaps deep-module-handbook on "test boundaries reveal interface depth"), name the overlap explicitly here so consumers know not to double-apply both handbooks' overlapping rules.

- <overlap pointer 1, e.g. "Overlaps deep-module-handbook §3 RF-deep-2 on pass-through methods. When both flags fire, prefer this handbook's recommendation because <reason>.">
- <overlap pointer 2>

If no overlaps exist, write `_(none)_` rather than removing the section — its absence is reviewable.
